---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact How to Fish Game Help about guide corrections, copyright concerns, or general questions." canonicalPath="/contact/">
  <article class="narrow section prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Corrections and rights requests</h1>
    <p>For guide corrections, copyright concerns, or general questions, email <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
    <p>Please include the page URL and the exact statement, image, broken link, or source you would like reviewed. For an outdated patch detail, include the version shown by the game and a link to any relevant official announcement.</p>
    <p>This address is published because the exact public Cloudflare Email Routing rule is configured. End-to-end receipt is a separate manual check; this page does not claim that a test message has been received.</p>
    <h2>What this site cannot do</h2>
    <p>How to Fish Game Help is independently operated. We cannot access player accounts, repair a save, issue a refund, moderate a Steam lobby, or provide customer support on behalf of Dazed Games, Steam, or Valve.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
